@Trotamundos_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### Registro
POST {{Trotamundos_HostAddress}}/api/auth/registro
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nombre": "Ana", "apellido": "Pérez", "email": "ana@test.com", "password": "Secreta123", "nacionalidad": "Argentina" }

### Login
POST {{Trotamundos_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@test.com", "password": "Secreta123" }

### Países
GET {{Trotamundos_HostAddress}}/api/mapas/paises?q=arg
